From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:42:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add dmc hooks install/uninstall/status for agent hooks

Preview the exact JSON change by default and write only with --apply.
Entries call an absolute path to the running dmc executable (or
--dmc-command). Install merges idempotently into existing config; uninstall
removes only handlers whose command exactly matches dmc's. Claude Code
defaults to the verified .claude/settings.local.json; Muse Code defaults to
~/.config/muse/settings.json and registers Interrupt as async.

Also records the session in STATUS.md (Done, Broken with the real test
results, Next), adds the CHANGELOG entry, and documents the end-to-end
Claude Code run in docs/AGENT-HOOKS.md.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TZntz1MeHVb13u53UKzx8U
